Good so far. XL14 is still some way off, maybe try to increase your XL by
other means, like a potion or two, or an incubus, to do the Quest.

>                                 Minetown's altar is neutral, so
> saccing is not an option unless I can convert it and take out the
> priest.  My AC is at -12.  Enchant armor has not been discovered
> yet, so aside from the +3 sdsm, most of the other armor is at +1.

You should be able to find better armor. BUC-id everything with a pet or
the altar (the mines are full of armor, after all) and try it on. Also,
identifying enchant armor shouldn't be too hard. It's not a rare scroll and
can be price-IDed easily.

> I have poison resistance, sleep resistance, cold resistance, telepathy,
> and teleport control.

Tele control is great to have. Do you have teleportitis yet? You are now
free to eat nymphs and leprechauns to get it. Then you can teleport to your
destination for free every so often, speeding things up, and at your XL (I
believe) you can also hit Ctrl-T to teleport out of a dangerous situation.

Other than that, you want fire resistance (Quest) and MR (hard to get.
GDSM, cloak, MagicBane. Maybe try to get a wish, but it can wait until you
start seeing titans or liches. Careful with polytraps, though).

>                        I am wearing an amulet of life saving, and I've
